WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.750
An unbalanced force changes the motion, in the direction of the net force.

2
00:00:05.828 --> 00:00:09.878
A puck slides right on ice, while a push to the left keeps acting.

3
00:00:13.402 --> 00:00:15.202
First it slows down.

4
00:00:15.751 --> 00:00:18.451
It stops, and then speeds up to the left.

5
00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:24.277
Slowing, stopping and reversing are all changes caused by one unbalanced force.
